# Project keep rules for R8, applied when `optimization { enable = true }` is on
# (see app/build.gradle.kts). The platform defaults — the equivalent of
# proguard-android-optimize.txt — are added automatically and don't belong here.
# https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/app-optimization/enable-app-optimization
#
# Nothing custom is needed today: the app has no reflection of its own, and the
# only reflective lookup in the dependency graph is Room resolving its generated
# `*_Impl` classes, which androidx.room already covers with its own consumer keep
# rules. Keep this file narrow — broad `-keep` rules block optimizations.
